@startuml
actor User
participant WebApp as "React Web Version"
participant Clerk as "Clerk Auth Service"
participant Backend as "FastAPI Gateway"

User -> WebApp : Click Login Button
WebApp -> Clerk : Redirect to login form / social OAuth
User -> Clerk : Submit credentials
Clerk --> WebApp : Redirect back with Session Token (JWT)
WebApp -> WebApp : Store Clerk JWT session state

WebApp -> Backend : GET /uploads/usage (With Bearer Token)
Backend -> Backend : Verify JWT against Clerk JWKS public keys
Backend --> WebApp : Return usage limits
@enduml
